    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mac Biskwi Adventures</strong> is a 2D platformer that brings back a nostalgic feeling and offers unique and fun-loving gameplay, with a mix of exploration and adventure. In a very solid and cute way. Fasten your seat belts\u2026 it\u2019s time to rescue Mac\u2019s missing girlfriend! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GO ON A JOURNEY OF DISCOVERY THROUGH BISCUIT\u2019S ISLAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different levels with colorful visuals and special routes to be discovered, cross the trees and make your way through Biscuit\u2019s Island while you get rid of evil creatures that are spreading the chaos on the Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/830aa1cb5864ff0ba11a821f1ddfac63.poster.avif?t=1731682048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/830aa1cb5864ff0ba11a821f1ddfac63.webm?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/830aa1cb5864ff0ba11a821f1ddfac63.mp4?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BISCUITS &amp; GOLDEN TOKENS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure to collect all the biscuits &amp; golden tokens you see! Some might be in hidden places, so don\u2019t forget to explore every single route of each map and don\u2019t leave any collectibles behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/fdfac171bc1764ca13948521fa376949.poster.avif?t=1731682048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/fdfac171bc1764ca13948521fa376949.webm?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/fdfac171bc1764ca13948521fa376949.mp4?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COOL VEHICLES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a new vehicle available in each level and be prepared for a few surprises\u2026 Show your skateboarding skills, ride a shooting tank and even a mecha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/ad834b56b4e445d75bdde7ba64a22867.poster.avif?t=1731682048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/ad834b56b4e445d75bdde7ba64a22867.webm?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/ad834b56b4e445d75bdde7ba64a22867.mp4?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BEAT BIG BOSSES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll get to beat big bosses at the end of each level! They might look scary and stronger than our little monkey, but Mac is smart! Don\u2019t forget to use walls to jump, avoid their abilities &amp; beat\u2019em up with your weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/8a8d18111dae1bfdcb742f8c38d27649.poster.avif?t=1731682048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/8a8d18111dae1bfdcb742f8c38d27649.webm?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/8a8d18111dae1bfdcb742f8c38d27649.mp4?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OVERVIEW</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A colorful and unexpected experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 unique levels and 6 bosses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different weapons for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple and smooth controls: you can use keyboard or a controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game modes: Normal and Hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels are filled with enemies who can only be defeated by jumping on them or using weapons like a boomerang or a laser gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the true ending by finishing the game in Hard mode!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mac Biskwi Adventures</strong> is a 2D platformer that brings back a nostalgic feeling and offers unique and fun-loving gameplay, with a mix of exploration and adventure. In a very solid and cute way. Fasten your seat belts\u2026 it\u2019s time to rescue Mac\u2019s missing girlfriend! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GO ON A JOURNEY OF DISCOVERY THROUGH BISCUIT\u2019S ISLAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different levels with colorful visuals and special routes to be discovered, cross the trees and make your way through Biscuit\u2019s Island while you get rid of evil creatures that are spreading the chaos on the Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/830aa1cb5864ff0ba11a821f1ddfac63.poster.avif?t=1731682048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/830aa1cb5864ff0ba11a821f1ddfac63.webm?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/830aa1cb5864ff0ba11a821f1ddfac63.mp4?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BISCUITS &amp; GOLDEN TOKENS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make sure to collect all the biscuits &amp; golden tokens you see! Some might be in hidden places, so don\u2019t forget to explore every single route of each map and don\u2019t leave any collectibles behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/fdfac171bc1764ca13948521fa376949.poster.avif?t=1731682048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/fdfac171bc1764ca13948521fa376949.webm?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/fdfac171bc1764ca13948521fa376949.mp4?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COOL VEHICLES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a new vehicle available in each level and be prepared for a few surprises\u2026 Show your skateboarding skills, ride a shooting tank and even a mecha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/ad834b56b4e445d75bdde7ba64a22867.poster.avif?t=1731682048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/ad834b56b4e445d75bdde7ba64a22867.webm?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/ad834b56b4e445d75bdde7ba64a22867.mp4?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BEAT BIG BOSSES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll get to beat big bosses at the end of each level! They might look scary and stronger than our little monkey, but Mac is smart! Don\u2019t forget to use walls to jump, avoid their abilities &amp; beat\u2019em up with your weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/8a8d18111dae1bfdcb742f8c38d27649.poster.avif?t=1731682048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/8a8d18111dae1bfdcb742f8c38d27649.webm?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1495170/extras/8a8d18111dae1bfdcb742f8c38d27649.mp4?t=1731682048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OVERVIEW</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A colorful and unexpected experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 unique levels and 6 bosses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different weapons for each level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple and smooth controls: you can use keyboard or a controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game modes: Normal and Hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels are filled with enemies who can only be defeated by jumping on them or using weapons like a boomerang or a laser gun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the true ending by finishing the game in Hard mode!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Mac Biskwi Adventures brings back a nostalgic feeling with a modern touch in this retro-inspired 2D platformer. Jump on this fun &amp; colorful journey, where you'll explore different levels, collect biscuits and golden tokens to help Mac rescue his missing girlfriend.",
